   "gap_before": 0.23,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "travel_planning.ctx7"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's lovely. A river cruise means no packing and unpacking, while a rail tour shows more scenery but has more walking. Which would suit them better?",
